# Milestone: v0.10.2-reactive (W1)
# Covers: OP_CLOSURE inside every() body must resolve nested closure protos.
#         Reactive audit F4 / audit-1 F4.
#
# Root cause (fixed): body strand armed without root_proto set, so at
# frame_count == 0 OP_CLOSURE found executing_proto == NULL and halted
# with "CLOSURE: proto index out of range".  Fix: spawn paths set
# body->root_proto = body_closure->proto before urbi_strand_start.
#
# Mechanism: every(1us, body_fn) registers a UPeriodic.  The body creates
# a function literal (OP_CLOSURE) on each fire and calls it.  The result
# is accumulated in Realm.result.  Two trailing statement lines pump
# enough urbi_step calls for the body to fire at least once.
#
# Note: sleep(duration) not yet available (W6 pending); the trailing
# no-op lines drive the cooperative scheduler instead.
#
# Activated: 2026-05-25 as part of v0.10.2-reactive W1.

var result = 0
every (1us) { var local_fn = function (x) { x * 2 } | Realm.result = local_fn(7) }
0
0
Realm.result
[00000000] 0
[00000000] nil
[00000000] 0
[00000000] 0
[00000000] 14
